{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1250980-changeling-magic","id":1250980,"title":"Changeling magic","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-09-02T23:20:57-07:00","id":1250980,"title":"Changeling magic","content":"Is it Fate oriented? Regarding crossover how would one run with it in regards to the Arcana? Would Fate work against Changelings like Spirit does against Werewolf Gifts?<br /> <br /> Not too familiar with Lost, but I'm assuming one can leave the borders of the Hedge using Space and/or Time (never entered in the first place). Sorry for the simplicity of this question.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23821-rathford","name":"Rathford","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23821_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-03T00:53:43-07:00","id":1250995,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rathford</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1250980-changeling-magic#post1250980\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is it Fate oriented? Regarding crossover how would one run with it in regards to the Arcana? Would Fate work against Changelings like Spirit does against Werewolf Gifts?<br /> <br /> Not too familiar with Lost, but I'm assuming one can leave the borders of the Hedge using Space and/or Time (never entered in the first place). Sorry for the simplicity of this question.</div> </div> </div> </div>The answers to most of these questions in 1e can be found in the Changeling supplement The Equinox Road on pages 74-75, but I'll here point out that Space alone is not going to get you into a completely different metaphysical dimension the way Death or Spirit can just on general principle.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-03T02:10:07-07:00","id":1250998,"title":"","content":"Depends on the power, but in general changeling stuff is Fate + Mind when it comes to their power set, as Meghan has said &quot;in Mage terms you can't use Fate alone to directly influence Wyrd-related phenomena, you need conjunctional Mind.&quot;<br /> <br /> Also you cannot leave the Hedge through magic iirc, but Dave has said you can use magic to enter it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/904596-geniuses-and-gramarie\" target=\"_blank\">Genius templates</a>: Super Science Mini-Template for Demon: the Descent<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1337874-oracle-the-endbringers-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Oracle the Endbringers</a>: Time-Manipulator Fan-Splat","edited":{"userid":8331,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","user":"milo v3","date":". 09-03-2018, 05:12 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","name":"milo v3","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-03T03:43:39-07:00","id":1251013,"title":"","content":"I wonder if you can drop a &quot;beacon&quot; near a known (and whose key is known) Hedge Gate, and use Teleport to get back to it. You aren't <i>technically</i> using magic to leave, you are using a Hedge Gate. You are just using magic to get to it easier. Considering how the Hedge &quot;moves around&quot;, you'll probably need to leave an object with a Sympathetic Connection there, rather than relying on your connection to the place.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-03T04:02:18-07:00","id":1251016,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>milo v3</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1250980-changeling-magic?p=1250998#post1250998\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Depends on the power, but in general changeling stuff is Fate + Mind when it comes to their power set, as Meghan has said &quot;in Mage terms you can't use Fate alone to directly influence Wyrd-related phenomena, you need conjunctional Mind.&quot;<br /> <br /> Also you cannot leave the Hedge through magic iirc, but Dave has said you can use magic to enter it.</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DaveB</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/872952-a-changeling-related-question?p=873580#post873580\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The basic rule of thumb is that Mage lumps any form of existing gateway together as an &quot;Iris&quot;; many require some specific means of opening them called a &quot;key&quot; in Mage-Lexicon, and opening one without the proper key is always a Weaving spell of the appropriate Arcanum.<br /> <br /> Head to your nearest graveyard and pop open the Avernian gate? Death 3. Open a hole in the Gauntlet that only opens under a bood moon? Spirit 3. Make that alley that leads from New York to Chicago without having to circle the block three times clockwise? Space 3.<br /> <br /> Opening an existing Hedge gate is Fate 3.<br /> <br /> Making an Iris when you don't have one available is always a Making spell. So, a Master of fate can rip their way out of the Hedge without a doorway, same way Death five has a spell to create Avernian gateways. Everyone else will be stuck looking for the exit.</div> </div> </div> </div>You can't teleport out of the Hedge or create a non-Hedge Gate portal (like Demon's Rip the Gates), but if you can create a Hedge Gate then you're free to use it as you see fit.<br /> <br /> Also, it might require equal parts Fate and Mind rather than just Fate now that Dave and Meghan has worked over the cosmology of the Hedge.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-03T09:35:53-07:00","id":1251080,"title":"","content":"<br /> Here's some comments by Dave:<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://img.fireden.net/tg/image/1492/55/1492559081380.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/618-branford","name":"branford","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar618_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1904"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-03T13:39:13-07:00","id":1251164,"title":"","content":"Hmmm. Perhaps best not to use Acanthus in Changeling crossover. Or Thyrsus in Werewolf. Helpful.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23821-rathford","name":"Rathford","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23821_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-03T15:48:12-07:00","id":1251205,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rathford</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1250980-changeling-magic?p=1251164#post1251164\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hmmm. Perhaps best not to use Acanthus in Changeling crossover. Or Thyrsus in Werewolf. Helpful.</div> </div> </div> </div>Depends on the capacity and intent. It *can* work so long as you plan with it mind.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}